    "description": "An amazing opportunity to own a piece of San Francisco in one of her premier neighborhoods. This top-floor studio is filled with natural light and exudes classic SF charm. Featuring hardwood floors, wainscoting, a clawfoot tub w/shower, double pane windows. The beautiful built-ins and a foldaway queen bed maximize the space. This unit even has a huge private storage room. The building showcases a rooftop deck with BBQ, Golden Gate Bridge views, shared free washer & dryer, secure entry system and an elevator. Located near the top of Nob Hill but conveniently close to bars, restaurants and shopping. Easily explore the city with nearby access to the cable cars and several bus lines. Sirkin TIC agreement."
